/T (The global video gaming industry is expected to grow from USD 199.74 billion in 2022 to USD 307.19 billion by 2029, showcasing a compound annual growth rate of 6.3% throughout the forecast timeframe. In 2021, the Asia Pacific region led the video game market, holding a market share of 52.8%. )
/E (The global video gaming industry is expected to grow from USD 199.74 billion in 2022 to USD 307.19 billion by 2029, showcasing a compound annual growth rate of 6.3% throughout the forecast timeframe. In 2021, the Asia Pacific region led the video game market, holding a market share of 52.8%. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
