<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 951 0 R
/E (Market Saturation: Large gaming companies often dominate the market, making it difficult for smaller service providers to compete. These big players can leverage their substantial financial resources for marketing, technology, and distribution, thereby overshadowing smaller competitors that struggle to gain visibility.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
