/P 959 0 R
/E (Complexity of Backend Systems: Game development increasingly involves complex backend systems to support multiplayer functionality, real-time updates, and cloud-based services. Without adequate backend expertise, studios may face significant challenges in creating stable, reliable gaming experiences, negatively impacting player retention and engagement.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
552 0 obj
<<
