/P 960 0 R
/E (Maintenance and Scalability Issues: A lack of backend expertise can result in ongoing challenges regarding the maintenance and scalability of games post-launch. Studios without robust backend systems may struggle to handle user growth or fix bugs, leading to potential reputational damage.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [6]
