/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Respondent gaming companies have indicated that well-publicized and accessible startup funding programs specifically for the gaming industry would provide a competitive edge to domestic gaming and stability at the most crucial stages of game development. )
/E (Respondent gaming companies have indicated that well-publicized and accessible startup funding programs specifically for the gaming industry would provide a competitive edge to domestic gaming and stability at the most crucial stages of game development. )
