566 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Access to capital is a crucial factor determining success for gaming ventures. In a world where global monetary tightening has resulted in the flight of foreign capital from emerging markets,  facilitating greater access to investments can enable a greater innovative appetite among Indian game developers and publishers, and improve the global presence of Indian gaming. While AVGC related funding initiatives have been proposed at the State level, a national gaming oriented fund which identifies unique and promising games may avoid the pitfalls of fragmented support. A national fund would also be able to prioritize support for the development of cutting-edge technologies such as AI, augmented reality \(AR\), virtual reality \(VR\), and blockchain in gaming. This would enable Indian companies to stay competitive with global gaming leaders in terms of technological innovation. )
/E (Access to capital is a crucial factor determining success for gaming ventures. In a world where global monetary tightening has resulted in the flight of foreign capital from emerging markets,  facilitating greater access to investments can enable a greater innovative appetite among Indian game developers and publishers, and improve the global presence of Indian gaming. While AVGC related funding initiatives have been proposed at the State level, a national gaming oriented fund which identifies unique and promising games may avoid the pitfalls of fragmented support. A national fund would also be able to prioritize support for the development of cutting-edge technologies such as AI, augmented reality \(AR\), virtual reality \(VR\), and blockchain in gaming. This would enable Indian companies to stay competitive with global gaming leaders in terms of technological innovation. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
