/P 963 0 R
/E (Enhancing the visibility and appeal of careers in game development is essential for attracting and retaining talent in the industry. This can be achieved through comprehensive talent development initiatives such as workshops, internships, and mentorship programs that connect aspiring developers with experienced professionals. Industry involvement in educational institutions can help better prepare students for careers in the field. Sharing success stories of established Indian game developers can also inspire new entrants and enhance the overall perception of career opportunities within the industry.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
