597 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 965 0 R
/E (There is a pressing need for public awareness campaigns aimed at reshaping the perception of gaming in India. Many individuals still hold limited or negative views about the gaming industry, often seeing it as solely a recreational activity. Campaigns should focus on educating the public about the positive impacts of gaming, including its potential for developing critical thinking skills, fostering creativity, and providing career opportunities. Collaborations with educational institutions, media platforms, and influencers can be instrumental in promoting a more balanced and informed perspective on gaming.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [7]
>>
