<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The All India Game Developers Forum \(AIGDF\) is a not-for-profit collective representing the interests of Indian game developers. AIGDF is committed to greater representation of Indian game developers as a key stakeholder of the AVGC sector. AIGDF endeavors to be an active contributor in shaping centers of excellence, technology labs and hubs, and dedicated coursework for game development. It also aims to be active in creating a healthy ecosystem of game developers and enablers.)
/E (The All India Game Developers Forum \(AIGDF\) is a not-for-profit collective representing the interests of Indian game developers. AIGDF is committed to greater representation of Indian game developers as a key stakeholder of the AVGC sector. AIGDF endeavors to be an active contributor in shaping centers of excellence, technology labs and hubs, and dedicated coursework for game development. It also aims to be active in creating a healthy ecosystem of game developers and enablers.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [3]
>>
